So the stack algorithm:
```
stack = []  # each entry: (index, absorption_time)
for i from n-1 down to 0:
    t0 = 0
    while stack:
        j, T_j = stack[-1]
        # compute catch time of j by i, starting from t0
        gap_t0 = (position[j] + speed[j]*t0) - (position[i] + speed[i]*t0)
        if gap_t0 <= distance:
            tau = t0
        elif speed[i] > speed[j]:
            tau = t0 + (gap_t0 - distance) / (speed[i] - speed[j])
        else:
            tau = inf
        if tau <= T_j:
            T_i = tau
            break
        else:
            t0 = T_j  # j absorbed at T_j, chase next from then
            stack.pop()
    else:
        T_i = inf  # stack empty, i survives (rightmost or caught nobody)
    if i absorbed: push (i, T_i)
    else: push (i, inf)
```

